=========================  ========================= PROJECT 1 ++ CHATBOT=========================  =========================
Real production-grade, 
Reusable chatbot platform, 
Not just a one-off chatbot.

====================================================================================================================================
We will designing it so that the generic chatbot platform is completely separated from business-specific logic.

Then a banking chatbot, insurance chatbot, telecom chatbot, HR chatbot, etc. 
becomes mostly a configuration/integration exercise rather than a new application.
